  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nYou can activate 1 of these effects;\r\n\u25CF
    Special Summon this card to your Main Monster Zone in its same column.\r\n\u25CF
    Move 1 monster in your Main Monster Zone to an adjacent (horizontal) Monster
    Zone.\r\nYou can only use this effect of \"Mamonaka the Vaylantz United\" once
    per turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \n3 \"Vaylantz\" monsters\r\nDuring the Main
    Phase (Quick Effect): You can target 1 Effect Monster in your opponent's Main
    Monster Zone; place that opponent's monster face-up as a Continuous Spell in
    their Spell & Trap Zone in its same column. (If the zone is occupied, destroy
    the occupying card, and if it is a Monster Card, your opponent loses LP equal
    to its ATK). You can only use this effect of \"Mamonaka the Vaylantz United\"
    once per turn. If this Special Summoned card you control is destroyed by your
    opponent's card effect: You can place this card in your Pendulum Zone."
